{
  "name": "final_answer",
  "arguments": {"answer": "The data has been successfully preprocessed and cleaned. The script loaded the specified wave datasets, harmonised missing values according to the provided metadata, and consolidated the mother's and father's highest qualifications using an earliest-valid-first approach. Two sets of variables were created: detailed 20-category variables (`educdtlma`, `educdtlpa`) and collapsed 5-level NVQ variables (`educma`, `educpa`). The final cleaned dataset containing only the ID (`NSID`) and these derived variables was written to `data/output/cleaned_data.csv`."}
}

